WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.484
This lesson shows you how to add one new practitioner or practice to the website directory.

2
00:00:05.484 --> 00:00:16.971
We will work carefully, keep the new record unpublished until it is complete, save only once, clear the applicable cache, and confirm what visitors can actually see on the live Practitioners page.

3
00:00:17.321 --> 00:00:23.858
You need a WordPress account with the Editor or Administrator role. Editor access is enough for this task.

4
00:00:23.858 --> 00:00:30.396
If you do not see Medical Practicioners in the left menu, stop and ask the website administrator for help.

5
00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:33.603
This lesson does not create or change user accounts.

6
00:00:33.953 --> 00:00:39.591
Open a web browser and go to rebekahspureliving.com forward slash W P dash admin.

7
00:00:39.591 --> 00:00:47.597
Enter your own username and password, then select Log In. Make sure the address begins with rebekahspureliving.com.

8
00:00:47.597 --> 00:00:49.964
Do not use an old staging address.

9
00:00:50.314 --> 00:00:54.000
In the black menu on the left, select Medical Practicioners.

10
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.636
The unusual spelling is the label used inside this WordPress website. Then select All Medical Practicioners.

11
00:01:00.636 --> 00:01:07.210
You should now see the existing directory records and the Add New Medical Practitioner button near the top.

12
00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:13.056
Select Add New Medical Practitioner one time. Create only one record for the approved listing.

13
00:01:13.056 --> 00:01:20.539
If the listing represents a clinic or team, one practice record can contain the practice name and the approved team information.

14
00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:26.210
Do not create a separate duplicate record for every person unless that is specifically requested.

15
00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:33.117
The new record should remain a draft while you work. Do not publish an empty or incomplete listing.

16
00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:39.276
Scroll to Meta Boxes and open Medical Practicioner fields. If those fields are missing, stop.

17
00:01:39.276 --> 00:01:43.117
Do not place the information in unrelated WordPress boxes.

18
00:01:43.467 --> 00:01:48.518
Find Medical Service. Check only the approved service category or categories.

19
00:01:48.518 --> 00:01:55.209
Read the complete list before choosing. Do not guess, create a new category, or select every category.

20
00:01:55.209 --> 00:02:01.048
The categories control how the listing appears when visitors filter the public directory.

21
00:02:01.398 --> 00:02:05.722
In Medical Center, enter the approved practice or organization name.

22
00:02:05.722 --> 00:02:12.335
In Medical Practitioner Full Name, enter the exact public name that should appear on the directory card.

23
00:02:12.335 --> 00:02:16.850
For a practice listing, use the approved practice or team display name.

24
00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:21.238
Match spelling, credentials, punctuation, and capitalization exactly.

25
00:02:21.588 --> 00:02:28.443
Find Medical Practitioner Description and select the Visual tab. Enter or paste the approved public description.

26
00:02:28.443 --> 00:02:31.993
Preserve the paragraph breaks so the text is easy to read.

27
00:02:31.993 --> 00:02:39.154
Do not add private health information, internal notes, unapproved claims, or information copied from another listing.

28
00:02:39.504 --> 00:02:42.035
Find Medical Practitioner Contact Info.

29
00:02:42.035 --> 00:02:50.279
Add only information approved for public display, such as the website, public email address, public phone number, and location.

30
00:02:50.279 --> 00:02:53.394
Make each link point to the correct destination.

31
00:02:53.394 --> 00:02:59.885
Remove placeholders and do not publish a private email address or personal phone number by accident.

32
00:03:00.235 --> 00:03:03.883
Before publishing, read every field from top to bottom.

33
00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:14.163
Confirm the service category, practice name, public name, description, phone number, email address, website, and location against the approved information.

34
00:03:14.163 --> 00:03:21.061
Correct every typo now. If anything is uncertain, leave the record as a draft and ask before publishing.

35
00:03:21.411 --> 00:03:26.808
When every required field is complete and approved, select Publish or Save one time.

36
00:03:26.808 --> 00:03:32.013
Wait for WordPress to confirm that the record was saved. Do not click repeatedly.

37
00:03:32.013 --> 00:03:35.741
Repeated clicks can create confusion or duplicate actions.

38
00:03:35.741 --> 00:03:39.982
If WordPress reports an error, read it before doing anything else.

39
00:03:40.332 --> 00:03:45.466
Return to All Medical Practicioners. Find the new record and hover over its row.

40
00:03:45.466 --> 00:03:49.316
If Clear Cache is available for that record, select it once.

41
00:03:49.316 --> 00:03:55.734
If the site also shows an approved Breeze or Varnish purge control, clear only the applicable cache.

42
00:03:55.734 --> 00:03:59.328
Do not change unrelated server or optimization settings.

43
00:03:59.678 --> 00:04:08.365
Open the exact public address, rebekahspureliving.com forward slash practitioners forward slash, without adding anything to the address.

44
00:04:08.365 --> 00:04:11.112
Search for the new name, practice, or city.

45
00:04:11.112 --> 00:04:19.288
Confirm that the correct card appears, the category and city are correct, and the public details match the approved information.

46
00:04:19.638 --> 00:04:22.501
Select View full listing on the directory card.

47
00:04:22.501 --> 00:04:28.834
Confirm that the expanded details, phone number, website, email, and description are visible and usable.

48
00:04:28.834 --> 00:04:31.574
Then repeat the check at a phone-size screen.

49
00:04:31.574 --> 00:04:39.064
There is no separate public practitioner page to manage; visitors use the Practitioners directory and its expanded listing.

50
00:04:39.414 --> 00:04:45.390
Every practitioner change ends with the same three checks. First, save the correct record.

51
00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:52.827
Second, clear only the applicable cache. Third, verify the exact public Practitioners page on desktop and phone.

52
00:04:52.827 --> 00:04:59.135
If the live result is wrong or missing, stop and ask for help instead of making random changes.
